sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant DS as Demo Server
    participant ES as Embedding Service
    participant SDK as ProximaDB SDK
    participant BERT as BERT Model
    participant PDB as ProximaDB Server
    
    Note over UI,PDB: Real BERT Embedding Workflow
    
    UI->>DS: POST /api/embeddings/chunk<br/>{text, strategy, model}
    DS->>ES: Initialize Embedding Service
    ES->>BERT: Load Model (all-MiniLM-L6-v2)
    BERT-->>ES: Model Ready (384-dim)
    
    ES->>SDK: chunk_text(strategy="sliding_window")
    SDK-->>ES: Text chunks with metadata
    
    loop For each chunk
        ES->>BERT: encode(chunk_text)
        BERT-->>ES: embedding_vector[384]
    end
    
    ES-->>DS: {chunks, embeddings, metadata}
    DS-->>UI: JSON Response with chunked embeddings
    
    Note over UI,PDB: Vector Storage & Search
    
    UI->>DS: POST /api/collections/{id}/insert<br/>{vectors: chunks+embeddings}
    DS->>PDB: gRPC/REST Insert Request
    PDB-->>DS: Insert Success
    DS-->>UI: Confirmation
    
    UI->>DS: POST /api/embeddings/search<br/>{query, chunks, top_k}
    DS->>ES: search_similar_chunks()
    ES->>BERT: encode(query)
    BERT-->>ES: query_vector[384]
    ES->>ES: cosine_similarity(query_vector, chunk_vectors)
    ES-->>DS: Ranked results with scores
    DS-->>UI: Similar chunks with similarity scores
    
    Note over UI,PDB: Consistent Seeds & Reproducibility
    ES->>BERT: Set torch.manual_seed(42)
    ES->>SDK: Set np.random.seed(42)
    Note right of ES: Same embeddings across<br/>JavaScript and Python